  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Resilience in the Sahel - Integrated Resilience Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 1 will help vulnerable people in protracted crisis contexts live a dignified life in displacement, be more resilient to climate stressors and be less reliant on humanitarian assistance. The programme will help refugees and host communities in areas where land degradation exacerbates food insecurity, to restore and manage their ecosystems, in order to increase the natural capital essential to their subsistence and livelihood.</narrative>
  </description>
